## 4. Content Types

Diversify your content to keep your audience engaged:

*   **How-to Guides:** Step-by-step instructions or troubleshooting tips (e.g., DSTV signal fixes).
*   **Case Studies:** Showcase successful projects (web design launches, vehicle wrap transformations) with before/after photos and client testimonials.
*   **Local News & Updates:** Comment on local business trends, technology news, or changes in regulations (e.g., new DSTV offerings).
*   **Interviews:** Feature satisfied clients or industry partners.
*   **Infographics/Visuals:** Summarize complex information in an easy-to-understand visual format (e.g., "Web Design Process").

## 5. Content Calendar Suggestion

Aim for consistent posting, ideally 2-4 blog posts per month. Here’s a sample monthly schedule:

*   **Week 1:** Web Design & SEO Tips
*   **Week 2:** Vehicle Branding Insights
*   **Week 3:** DSTV & Home Installations Guide
*   **Week 4:** Toran Digital Success Story or General Business Growth Tip

**Promotion:** Share each new blog post across your social media channels (WhatsApp, Facebook, Instagram) with engaging snippets and calls to action. Use relevant hashtags to increase visibility.

By consistently creating high-quality, keyword-rich content, Toran Digital will attract organic traffic, establish authority, and convert visitors into valuable clients across all its service areas.
